# The Mithra and the Crystal: a party's kill. Main spawns the Ancient Vessel and kills it with bob in the party: both
# chars' onMobDeath run (main the killer), so bob's nmDefeated is set too and bob's qm7 plays 13, whose option 1 gives
# bob the Scrap of Papyrus.
lists LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/111 Norg/_700/onTrigger Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Rabao/Maryoh_Comyujah/onTrigger Rabao/onEventFinish/81 Rabao/onEventFinish/83 QuicksandCaves/qm7/onTrigger QuicksandCaves/onEventFinish/12 QuicksandCaves/onEventFinish/13 QuicksandCaves/Ancient_Vessel/onMobDeath HallOfTheGods/_6z0/onTrigger HallOfTheGods/Shimmering_Circle/onTrigger HallOfTheGods/onEventFinish/3
char zone=QuicksandCaves pos=-504,19,-419 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=QuicksandCaves pos=-504,19,-419 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheMithraAndTheCrystal current
bob: mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
bob: mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
bob: mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
bob: mission Soa Abomination current
bob: mission Zilart TheMithraAndTheCrystal current
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
missionstatus Zilart 1                  # a GM
bob: missionstatus Zilart 1             # a GM
trigger qm7 at=1                        # 12
finish option=1                         # SOMETHING_ATTACKING_YOU
kill ANCIENT_VESSEL                     # main the killer; bob's handler too
bob: trigger qm7 at=1                   # 13
bob: finish option=1                    # bob's papyrus
